00:04:02,727 --> 00:04:08,727
This house looked like an easy target, until they found what was inside.

2
00:08:05,454 --> 00:08:11,454
Don't Breathe is a horror, thriller, crime film directed by Fede Álvarez.

3
00:12:08,181 --> 00:12:14,181
A group of teens break into a blind man's home thinking
they'll get away with the perfect crime.

4
00:16:10,909 --> 00:16:16,909
They're wrong.

5
00:20:13,636 --> 00:20:19,636
The Blind Man, played by Stephen Lang.

6
00:24:16,363 --> 00:24:22,363
Rocky, played by Jane Levy.

7
00:28:19,090 --> 00:28:25,090
Alex, played by Dylan Minnette.

8
00:32:21,818 --> 00:32:27,818
Money, played by Daniel Zovatto.

9
00:36:24,545 --> 00:36:30,545
Diddy, played by Emma Bercovici.

10
00:40:27,272 --> 00:40:33,272
